---
import OptimizedImage from "../../../components/OptimizedImage.astro";
---
<div class="w-full"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/99641c8a559e.webp" alt="表紙" width="1766" height="1796" class="block w-full h-60 mb:h-90 dt:h-115 object-cover object-center" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /></div>

    <article class="px-6 mb:px-16 dt:px-35 pt-10">
      <header>
        <h1 class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10">ハスの庭仕事 - 2019</h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[18px] leading-6 font-medium">イラスト：Thuy An</p>
      </header>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word">この絵本は、ハスという男の子とその冒険を描いた全4巻シリーズの一冊です。文章は Trang Kyu が担当し、イラストを私が担当しました。</p>

      <section class="mt-14 mb:mt-16" aria-label="作品">
        <h2 class="sr-only">作品</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 dt:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb:gap-12.5 items-start">
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/11aff4210130.webp" alt="作品 1" width="1184" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/4985ed146357.webp" alt="作品 2" width="1176" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/bede46b659a3.webp" alt="作品 3" width="1135" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/5176bb3bce74.webp" alt="作品 4" width="1143" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/a110ab7512d7.webp" alt="作品 5" width="1128" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/3c63dfb426a4.webp" alt="作品 6" width="1200" height="1126" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/d4d853a2a0d6.webp" alt="作品 7" width="1200" height="1174" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/8b00139a1547.webp" alt="作品 8" width="1133" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/4cfef5cbf01e.webp" alt="作品 9" width="1147" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/a711f1a8df47.webp" alt="作品 10" width="1132" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/9c2b14f783df.webp" alt="作品 11" width="1145" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/17758fcf1327.webp" alt="作品 12" width="1162" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        </div>
        </section>

      <div class="mt-18 mb:mt-22 flex flex-col items-center gap-10 mb:gap-11">
        <OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/b9d212a2b70a.webp" alt="締めくくりのイラスト" width="1200" height="978" class="block w-50 h-50 mb:w-62.5 mb:h-62.5 rounded-full object-cover object-center mx-auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <p class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10 text-center">ご覧いただき、ありがとうございました！</p>
      </div>

      <a href="/jp/illustration" id="back-link" class="img-btn block w-34 h-6.5 mt-17 mb-21 bg-left!" style="background-image:url(/assets/icons/back.png)" aria-label="もどる" title="もどる"></a>
    </article>
